# Upstream third-party code: this repo is a fork of tpruvot/cpuminer-multi
# (https://github.com/tpruvot/cpuminer-multi). These directories are bundled
# hashing libraries and algorithm implementations from upstream (sphlib in
# sha3/, floodyberry scrypt-jane in scryptjane/, Lyra2, yescrypt, crypto
# primitives and per-algorithm miners), not first-party code.
algo/
asm/
compat/
crypto/
lyra2/
scryptjane/
sha3/
yescrypt/
